# Papirus-Dark with the tray icons of Discord, Steam and qBittorrent in the
# bar's text colour, Catppuccin Mocha @text (#cdd6f4), where Papirus draws
# them in its grey (#dfdfdf). The GTK icon theme (hosts/laptop/home-shared.nix,
# gtk.iconTheme) is this one, and waybar's tray looks the apps' icon names
# up in it. Everything else comes from Papirus-Dark, so the apps' own icons
# (launchers, menus, windows) stay as they were: only tray-only names live
# here.
#  - steam_tray_mono: Steam's tray icon name.
#  - qbittorrent-tray: qBittorrent's tray icon in its default style;
#    qbittorrent-tray-dark, its monochrome style for dark panels, is the
#    same icon (a symlink).
#  - discord-tray: Discord's tray icon is a picture, not a name, so waybar
#    maps Discord to this name (config.jsonc, tray "icons").
# A theme of its own rather than icons merged into Papirus-Dark: GTK takes
# the first theme in the chain that has a name at any size, so these win
# at the 16 px icon size and at 32 px (scale 2) alike, where merged ones
# would lose to Papirus' own 16x16@2x art.
[Icon Theme]
Name=Papirus-Dark-Tray
Comment=Papirus-Dark with tray icons in Catppuccin Mocha's text colour
Inherits=Papirus-Dark
Directories=16x16/panel

[16x16/panel]
Context=Status
Size=16
Type=Fixed
